  {
    "name": "erp_data_read",
    "description": "Read current-workspace authorized business rows with exact RLS-filtered total and stable primary-key pagination. Discover entity/fields with erp_data_catalog. Fields and scalar equality filters are allowlisted; search is literal substring in one catalog field marked searchable:true (not UUIDs/enums). The reserved PostgREST '*' wildcard is rejected; use equality filters for such exact values. Long text/JSON is an explicitly marked preview plus _text full-length/hash/read pointer; use erp_data_text for full content. Never sum bounded rows into workspace totals. Raw invoices do not replace list_invoices/finance_summary settlement snapshots.",
